Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='mailreads', at=datetime(2026, 9, 4, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='Mail is read-only in the app: notmuch as a subprocess, bodies as capped text, the disposition a badge', body="*Mail* (2026-09-04), read-only: notmuch as a SUBPROCESS, maildir through `mail-parser`, the agent's own queries, at `/api/mail/{inbox,search,message/<id>,thread/<id>}` behind the same gate. Bodies are TEXT (HTML converted, capped at 200 KB, the cut declared); links filtered to http/https/mailto; the agent's disposition is a BADGE, never a filter (an inbox is by DATE; `do_new`'s watermark is the queue's question); reads ask the notmuch INDEX for the newest ids first (loading a message hashes every file it matches). The canonical hash is reproduced byte for byte, CPython's two-digit-year cutoff included (triage state and every `source.hash` key on it); `source.hash` lookups are a prefix test with a six-character floor.", rationale='Decided 2026-09-04.', supersedes=()))